1
00:00:02,624 --> 00:00:06,629
(Episode 11)

2
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:29,255
Yu Mi attempted suicide.

3
00:00:32,997 --> 00:00:33,997
What did you say?

4
00:00:34,829 --> 00:00:36,688
Didn't you know that?

5
00:00:39,246 --> 00:00:43,041
I wonder if Jun Seo and Eun Seo
still want to get married.

6
00:01:15,621 --> 00:01:17,567
What can I do for you?

7
00:01:18,635 --> 00:01:19,733
Eun Seo.

8
00:01:20,772 --> 00:01:21,772
Yes.

9
00:01:22,892 --> 00:01:24,448
Bring me some drinks.

10
00:01:33,285 --> 00:01:34,423
Don't worry.

11
00:01:35,117 --> 00:01:37,839
I'm not going to attempt suicide
like a certain someone.

12
00:01:45,067 --> 00:01:46,406
Shin Yu Mi,

13
00:01:49,781 --> 00:01:53,855
how stupid she was.
She didn't even succeed.

14
00:01:56,399 --> 00:01:57,567
I'm not going to die.

15
00:02:04,532 --> 00:02:06,597
I will not.

16
00:02:06,597 --> 00:02:08,143
I will never die.

17
00:02:09,405 --> 00:02:12,126
I'm not going to die before you do.

18
00:02:14,893 --> 00:02:19,967
I will not die before I get to witness

19
00:02:21,668 --> 00:02:23,257
what happy lives you get to lead.

20
00:02:26,285 --> 00:02:28,016
Please don't.

21
00:02:29,772 --> 00:02:33,193
That would be unfair to you
if we were to live happily.

22
00:02:34,677 --> 00:02:36,849
So, please don't forgive us.

23
00:02:38,718 --> 00:02:40,240
Don't forgive me.

24
00:02:41,087 --> 00:02:42,609
Don't forgive me, please.

25
00:02:47,701 --> 00:02:49,417
I will leave now.

26
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:09,032
Eun Seo.

27
00:03:10,206 --> 00:03:11,272
Choi Eun Seo.

28
00:03:52,058 --> 00:03:55,106
How are you feeling?
Are you feeling better?

29
00:03:55,106 --> 00:03:56,627
I'm fine.

30
00:03:56,627 --> 00:03:58,734
It doesn't hurt at all
since you're doing that.

31
00:04:00,257 --> 00:04:01,257
Hold on.

32
00:04:02,521 --> 00:04:03,572
Hello.

33
00:04:05,824 --> 00:04:07,100
Yes, Tae Seok.

34
00:04:08,689 --> 00:04:11,413
Eun Seo fainted. She fainted.

35
00:04:16,632 --> 00:04:19,042
I'm taking her to the hospital.
You can come to...

36
00:04:24,383 --> 00:04:25,627
Jun Seo.

37
00:04:28,224 --> 00:04:30,915
Jun Seo, are you there? Are you listening?

38
00:04:35,312 --> 00:04:36,514
Yoon Jun Seo.

39
00:04:55,328 --> 00:04:56,328
You...

40
00:04:59,156 --> 00:05:00,744
Are you with someone?

41
00:05:03,091 --> 00:05:05,461
Tae Seok.

42
00:05:05,461 --> 00:05:08,551
Yu Mi got hurt a lot, so...

43
00:05:20,513 --> 00:05:23,068
It's all right.
I'll take you to the hospital.

44
00:05:26,881 --> 00:05:28,126
I'll take care of you.

45
00:05:29,777 --> 00:05:30,892
Don't worry.

46
00:05:49,739 --> 00:05:51,020
Jun Seo.

47
00:05:53,772 --> 00:05:54,772
Yes.

48
00:06:02,844 --> 00:06:05,396
When you're with me like you are now,

49
00:06:05,396 --> 00:06:07,349
I feel much better.

50
00:06:09,141 --> 00:06:11,968
Will you stay until I fall asleep?

51
00:06:16,421 --> 00:06:17,421
Yes.

52
00:06:20,492 --> 00:06:22,788
Please arrange examinations
for the patient tomorrow.

53
00:06:22,788 --> 00:06:24,957
- Yes.
- What is wrong with her?

54
00:06:24,957 --> 00:06:26,509
It's exhaustion from overwork.

55
00:06:26,509 --> 00:06:28,477
What do you mean by overwork?

56
00:06:28,477 --> 00:06:30,925
How could a person faint like that
from exhaustion from overwork?

57
00:06:30,925 --> 00:06:32,814
She just needs a few more exams tomorrow.

58
00:06:32,814 --> 00:06:34,957
- Give me the examination form.
- Yes.

59
00:06:34,957 --> 00:06:36,151
Here you are.

60
00:06:37,569 --> 00:06:39,884
Why does she need so many examinations?
They would tire her out.

61
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,053
Excuse me.

62
00:07:23,614 --> 00:07:25,744
What have you gone through?

63
00:07:29,757 --> 00:07:30,757
What happened?

64
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:50,769
Eun Seo fainted. She fainted.

65
00:07:55,694 --> 00:07:56,808
Jun Seo.

66
00:08:00,207 --> 00:08:02,414
Drive safely.

67
00:08:02,414 --> 00:08:03,913
And come back.

68
00:08:05,629 --> 00:08:09,107
I'll be waiting for you.

69
00:10:09,021 --> 00:10:10,426
What happened?

70
00:10:13,125 --> 00:10:15,337
What happened between you and Jun Seo?

71
00:10:18,151 --> 00:10:20,097
Jun Seo said he couldn't come
when you were sick.

72
00:10:20,097 --> 00:10:22,093
He said he couldn't come because of Yu Mi.

73
00:10:23,690 --> 00:10:24,910
What does that mean?

74
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:32,325
Did you...

75
00:10:34,722 --> 00:10:36,166
break up with Jun Seo?

76
00:10:38,738 --> 00:10:42,942
Is that why you are sick?

77
00:10:44,203 --> 00:10:46,510
Is that why you fainted
when you were with me?

78
00:10:49,851 --> 00:10:50,975
Did you break up with him?

79
00:10:53,843 --> 00:10:56,633
I want to go home. Please let me go.

80
00:10:56,633 --> 00:10:57,683
Did you break up with him?

81
00:11:10,417 --> 00:11:11,851
I want to go home.

82
00:11:12,528 --> 00:11:14,779
How stupid you are. You are fools.

83
00:11:17,817 --> 00:11:18,979
Are you a fool?

84
00:11:19,818 --> 00:11:22,271
Is this what you wanted
after you hurt me so?

85
00:11:22,271 --> 00:11:23,835
What is wrong with you?

86
00:11:29,745 --> 00:11:31,184
What am I supposed to do
if you're like this?

87
00:11:31,184 --> 00:11:33,187
What am I supposed to do
if you two are like this?

88
00:11:35,289 --> 00:11:39,386
What am I supposed to do?

89
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,441
Choi Eun Seo.

90
00:11:46,549 --> 00:11:48,034
You are...

91
00:12:10,981 --> 00:12:12,415
Mom, I'm heading to work now.

92
00:12:14,022 --> 00:12:15,022
Yes.

93
00:12:19,654 --> 00:12:23,019
Mom. I know you don't want to see me.

94
00:12:24,215 --> 00:12:27,226
I know you hate me
for hating your daughter Eun Seo.

95
00:12:28,311 --> 00:12:30,721
But can you look at me at least
when I'm leaving?

96
00:12:32,070 --> 00:12:33,202
Sin Ae.

97
00:12:36,015 --> 00:12:37,019
Come here.

98
00:12:39,816 --> 00:12:40,916
Come.

99
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,099
Sit here.

100
00:12:52,926 --> 00:12:53,979
Sin Ae.

101
00:12:55,983 --> 00:13:02,446
I'm sorry that I haven't been good...

102
00:13:02,446 --> 00:13:03,513
to you.

103
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:08,701
Mom, you shouldn't be like this.

104
00:13:08,701 --> 00:13:10,658
Please stop lying on your bed.

105
00:13:11,631 --> 00:13:14,826
Didn't you expect this
when you switched Eun Seo and me?

106
00:13:16,095 --> 00:13:18,134
Why are you still like this
when Jun Seo and Eun Seo...

107
00:13:18,134 --> 00:13:19,537
broke up?

108
00:13:20,973 --> 00:13:26,449
Did Eun Seo break up with Jun Seo?

109
00:13:36,126 --> 00:13:37,456
Did Eun Seo...

110
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:42,826
Eun Seo...

111
00:13:42,826 --> 00:13:45,817
Mom, please stop doing this.

112
00:13:45,817 --> 00:13:48,792
If you keep doing this, it would seem like
things went wrong...

113
00:13:48,792 --> 00:13:50,284
because I came here instead of Eun Seo.

114
00:14:09,112 --> 00:14:10,112
Eun Seo.

115
00:14:19,814 --> 00:14:24,832
If I knew it would turn out like this,

116
00:14:27,446 --> 00:14:29,784
I should've let you two meet.

117
00:14:34,431 --> 00:14:36,304
I should've let you see each other.

118
00:14:40,190 --> 00:14:41,610
I shouldn't have been against it.

119
00:14:43,493 --> 00:14:44,601
Don't say that.

120
00:14:46,413 --> 00:14:48,480
I am sorry for not listening to you.

121
00:14:51,277 --> 00:14:53,601
We did wrong.

122
00:14:55,518 --> 00:14:57,808
I'm sorry for hurting you and Dad.

123
00:15:00,591 --> 00:15:03,297
How much of a heartbreak did you suffer?

124
00:15:04,734 --> 00:15:06,744
How much were you hurt?

125
00:15:07,408 --> 00:15:09,382
I'm all right.

126
00:15:09,382 --> 00:15:11,617
I'm fine. Don't feel sorry.

127
00:15:13,597 --> 00:15:15,937
I feel terrible that
I have given you so much pain.

128
00:15:18,823 --> 00:15:21,001
I don't know what I can do.

129
00:15:21,446 --> 00:15:22,753
I'm fine.

130
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:24,991
It's all right.

131
00:15:25,703 --> 00:15:27,161
I'm good, really.

132
00:15:28,654 --> 00:15:30,552
It is not your fault.

133
00:15:31,783 --> 00:15:33,945
It is not your fault or Dad's fault.

134
00:16:02,056 --> 00:16:03,389
You're late.

135
00:16:04,233 --> 00:16:07,188
You should've switched shifts
since you're not well.

136
00:16:10,183 --> 00:16:11,250
What's this?

137
00:16:12,262 --> 00:16:16,691
It's not like you. What is this about?

138
00:16:18,798 --> 00:16:20,792
Mom, give it to me. I'll do it.

139
00:16:28,478 --> 00:16:31,385
Eun Seo, have you done something?

140
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:34,280
Have you and your brother...

141
00:16:39,006 --> 00:16:42,025
He's getting married.

142
00:16:45,774 --> 00:16:47,160
What do you mean?

143
00:16:52,558 --> 00:16:57,121
He's getting married to the woman
he was going to.

144
00:16:59,254 --> 00:17:03,193
So, don't worry anymore.

145
00:17:14,574 --> 00:17:17,675
Eun Seo, come here.

146
00:18:00,236 --> 00:18:01,246
Dad.

147
00:18:07,172 --> 00:18:08,358
Thank you...

148
00:18:10,083 --> 00:18:11,831
for changing your mind.

149
00:18:16,476 --> 00:18:22,558
I would like to thank Eun Seo as well.
I do.

150
00:18:24,524 --> 00:18:26,055
It would not have been easy for her.

151
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:31,728
Yes, I would like to thank her, too.

152
00:18:33,316 --> 00:18:38,012
Perhaps you confused
them for feelings for love...

153
00:18:39,845 --> 00:18:42,535
since you two are so much alike.

154
00:18:44,366 --> 00:18:45,446
Yes.

155
00:18:48,835 --> 00:18:50,261
We were, maybe.

156
00:18:53,595 --> 00:18:58,036
You are very like me.

157
00:19:03,851 --> 00:19:06,378
I knew you would come to your senses...

158
00:19:08,054 --> 00:19:10,353
and do the right thing responsibly.

159
00:19:17,454 --> 00:19:19,632
Time will heal everything.

160
00:19:22,766 --> 00:19:23,923
It will.

161
00:19:26,198 --> 00:19:27,257
Dad.

162
00:19:31,814 --> 00:19:33,057
Please tell me.

163
00:19:35,887 --> 00:19:38,002
You said I am like you.

164
00:19:40,847 --> 00:19:43,017
What would you do if you were me?

165
00:19:44,871 --> 00:19:46,041
Please tell me.

166
00:19:49,871 --> 00:19:52,234
Please tell me how I can be okay.

167
00:19:55,855 --> 00:19:56,931
I...

168
00:19:59,751 --> 00:20:02,327
was going to be with Eun Seo...

169
00:20:02,327 --> 00:20:05,151
even if you and Mom were to get hurt
and everyone was to blame us.

170
00:20:09,271 --> 00:20:10,624
Because I love Eun Seo.

171
00:20:16,287 --> 00:20:18,296
What if I can never be better?

172
00:20:21,078 --> 00:20:24,035
Dad, what can I do?

173
00:20:28,184 --> 00:20:30,724
Please tell me how to stop this pain.

174
00:20:39,602 --> 00:20:41,069
It hurts so much.

175
00:21:22,159 --> 00:21:24,917
(Private View of Yoon Jun Seo)

176
00:21:28,770 --> 00:21:30,304
What are you doing?

177
00:21:30,304 --> 00:21:32,337
It's nothing.

178
00:21:32,337 --> 00:21:34,130
What is it?

179
00:21:34,130 --> 00:21:35,202
No.

180
00:21:35,202 --> 00:21:38,082
I said it's nothing.

181
00:21:38,082 --> 00:21:40,099
It's really nothing worth seeing.

182
00:21:40,705 --> 00:21:42,136
Okay.

183
00:21:42,973 --> 00:21:46,009
Aren't you hungry? I am.

184
00:21:46,009 --> 00:21:47,658
Do you want cup noodles?

185
00:21:47,658 --> 00:21:49,563
That sounds good. Let's go.

186
00:21:57,674 --> 00:21:59,188
I read it all already.

187
00:21:59,993 --> 00:22:02,176
Let's go and eat cup noodles.

188
00:22:02,176 --> 00:22:03,212
Okay.

189
00:22:21,551 --> 00:22:22,835
How have you been?

190
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:27,907
Are you feeling better?

191
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,418
Yes.

192
00:22:33,376 --> 00:22:34,812
Aren't you even going to look at me?

193
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:41,771
I can't believe he is having
his private exhibition at your workplace.

194
00:22:42,928 --> 00:22:45,091
He's so cold-hearted, isn't he?

195
00:22:50,025 --> 00:22:52,812
You look at me
only when I mention his name.

196
00:22:55,537 --> 00:22:58,427
Yes, I know.

197
00:23:01,608 --> 00:23:02,659
I'm sorry.

198
00:23:03,313 --> 00:23:05,618
Can you stop saying you're sorry?

199
00:23:12,289 --> 00:23:15,308
Haven't you thought
why I haven't bothered you at all?

200
00:23:19,457 --> 00:23:21,002
I went to Seoul.

201
00:23:22,881 --> 00:23:27,548
I think I might be
kicked out of the family.

202
00:23:30,281 --> 00:23:31,284
Why is that?

203
00:23:33,425 --> 00:23:37,114
I told them I was going to marry you.

204
00:23:40,057 --> 00:23:42,851
I don't worry about
getting kicked out of the family.

205
00:23:43,712 --> 00:23:46,447
I could do golf or art.

206
00:23:46,447 --> 00:23:48,388
I can take care of myself.

207
00:23:50,113 --> 00:23:52,516
But my family is very snobbish.

208
00:23:56,112 --> 00:23:58,780
So, I'm not sure
how you can bear with them.

209
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,187
Nevertheless...

210
00:24:08,585 --> 00:24:09,618
marry me.

211
00:24:30,195 --> 00:24:33,314
I like it. Thank you for your concern.

212
00:24:33,314 --> 00:24:35,656
It might be the most humble one
among all the spaces...

213
00:24:35,656 --> 00:24:38,811
but I do think this suits
your pieces the best.

214
00:24:38,811 --> 00:24:39,839
Yes.

215
00:24:43,002 --> 00:24:44,172
Jun Seo,

216
00:24:45,135 --> 00:24:48,961
why don't you meet Eun Seo
since you're here?

217
00:24:50,064 --> 00:24:51,558
You haven't seen each other
for a while, have you?

218
00:24:55,703 --> 00:24:58,514
No, I haven't.

219
00:25:02,184 --> 00:25:04,621
But I'm afraid I don't have time today.

220
00:25:05,665 --> 00:25:06,675
You don't?

221
00:25:08,104 --> 00:25:12,868
I was surprised when I learned
you had your preview here.

222
00:25:12,868 --> 00:25:14,726
I thought you wouldn't do it.

223
00:25:15,218 --> 00:25:19,691
No, I thought you couldn't do it here.

224
00:25:19,691 --> 00:25:21,639
So, I was a little disappointed.

225
00:25:23,099 --> 00:25:25,334
I'm out of line, aren't I?

226
00:25:27,202 --> 00:25:28,256
It's all right.

227
00:25:30,244 --> 00:25:32,155
I am sorry.

228
00:25:32,155 --> 00:25:33,963
I wanted to see it.

229
00:25:34,984 --> 00:25:39,442
I wanted to see you overcome obstacles,
and never give up.

230
00:25:42,104 --> 00:25:44,187
Are you setting the pieces tomorrow?

231
00:25:45,455 --> 00:25:46,455
Yes.

232
00:25:48,697 --> 00:25:52,211
I should get going.
Good luck with your private view.

233
00:25:54,001 --> 00:25:55,001
Excuse me.

234
00:26:00,257 --> 00:26:01,428
Thank you.

235
00:26:03,129 --> 00:26:05,618
I hope more people tell me things like,

236
00:26:07,952 --> 00:26:12,351
"I'm so disappointed," "You're a bad man,"

237
00:26:12,351 --> 00:26:14,355
"How could you do that?"

238
00:26:17,513 --> 00:26:19,977
I'd like to hear that rather than
"I can understand."

239
00:26:24,416 --> 00:26:26,130
See you around.

240
00:27:20,151 --> 00:27:21,151
Hello.

241
00:27:22,032 --> 00:27:23,307
Yes, Yu Mi.

242
00:27:24,057 --> 00:27:25,436
Yes, it's me.

243
00:27:26,152 --> 00:27:29,043
I just checked out the venue.
You chose the good one.

244
00:27:30,224 --> 00:27:31,877
Yes, I like it.

245
00:27:33,169 --> 00:27:34,290
Do you?

246
00:27:36,536 --> 00:27:38,833
If you don't like doing it
at that hotel...

247
00:27:38,833 --> 00:27:41,648
It's okay.

248
00:27:41,648 --> 00:27:42,851
I don't mind.

249
00:27:48,072 --> 00:27:49,481
Okay. I got it.

250
00:27:50,520 --> 00:27:53,137
I will get some fruit.

251
00:27:53,137 --> 00:27:54,540
Yes, see you in a bit.

252
00:28:56,369 --> 00:28:57,900
- How have you...
- How have you...

253
00:29:02,537 --> 00:29:03,878
How have you been?

254
00:29:06,493 --> 00:29:07,830
I heard you were sick.

255
00:29:10,354 --> 00:29:12,496
It was just a cold.

256
00:29:14,636 --> 00:29:16,175
Was it bad?

257
00:29:17,884 --> 00:29:18,884
No.

258
00:29:20,207 --> 00:29:21,497
I'm fine now.

259
00:29:23,736 --> 00:29:24,737
I see.

260
00:29:31,375 --> 00:29:32,720
Why don't you drink your coffee?

261
00:29:33,807 --> 00:29:35,911
- It will get cold.
- Right.

262
00:29:44,051 --> 00:29:47,198
Eun Seo, did you get sick...

263
00:29:48,028 --> 00:29:49,435
because you waited for me that day?

264
00:29:49,435 --> 00:29:50,435
That day.

265
00:29:53,419 --> 00:29:56,069
Jun Seo, I wasn't there, actually.

266
00:29:56,945 --> 00:29:58,534
I didn't go that day, either.

267
00:30:01,771 --> 00:30:04,669
I've also decided to care about myself.

268
00:30:06,171 --> 00:30:08,149
I couldn't go that day.

269
00:30:11,163 --> 00:30:14,063
After what Yu Mi did,
I've been reconsidering things.

270
00:30:15,804 --> 00:30:17,033
And...

271
00:30:18,798 --> 00:30:21,090
I can't beat Yu Mi.

272
00:30:23,662 --> 00:30:25,361
I couldn't ever do what she did.

273
00:30:28,213 --> 00:30:32,601
I couldn't leave with you.

274
00:30:37,998 --> 00:30:39,123
My...

275
00:30:42,207 --> 00:30:43,826
love was...

276
00:30:46,239 --> 00:30:48,122
only about that deep.

277
00:30:50,104 --> 00:30:51,317
Maybe...

278
00:30:53,883 --> 00:30:56,517
it's because we missed each other
so much for a long time,

279
00:30:58,378 --> 00:31:00,188
that we got confused about our feelings.

280
00:31:01,330 --> 00:31:03,220
Yes, that was it.

281
00:31:08,329 --> 00:31:09,344
Yes.

282
00:31:11,963 --> 00:31:13,510
I wish you were right.

283
00:31:19,667 --> 00:31:21,213
I hope so.

284
00:31:41,941 --> 00:31:43,199
It's Tae Seok.

285
00:31:48,245 --> 00:31:52,983
He is so generous to take me back.

286
00:31:54,734 --> 00:31:55,895
He proposed to me.

287
00:32:00,941 --> 00:32:03,111
He said he might get kicked out
of his family.

288
00:32:04,949 --> 00:32:06,535
I don't know what to do,
but I feel apologetic.

289
00:32:09,373 --> 00:32:13,081
But he said I should trust him.
He said he would be good to me.

290
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:16,600
Eun Seo.

291
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:20,268
You told me not to be sorry.

292
00:32:21,729 --> 00:32:24,340
But it's not because of what you said.

293
00:32:27,336 --> 00:32:31,683
I want to be happy.

294
00:32:33,009 --> 00:32:35,020
I want to do better this time.

295
00:32:36,264 --> 00:32:38,030
I think I can do it.

296
00:32:57,091 --> 00:32:59,503
Jun Seo, Why don't you say anything?

297
00:33:03,356 --> 00:33:08,200
Don't you have anything to say to me?

298
00:33:11,540 --> 00:33:12,896
Don't you have anything?

299
00:33:19,884 --> 00:33:21,738
I have so much to say to you,

300
00:33:24,817 --> 00:33:26,180
but I can't.

301
00:33:30,354 --> 00:33:32,550
All I want to say to you is...

302
00:33:38,419 --> 00:33:40,678
something I shouldn't say out loud.

303
00:33:43,226 --> 00:33:44,350
Everything is.

304
00:34:48,395 --> 00:34:49,536
I should get going.

305
00:35:55,272 --> 00:35:57,534
You are back, Jun Seo.

306
00:35:57,534 --> 00:35:58,568
You're late.

307
00:36:06,311 --> 00:36:08,897
I only packed the essentials,
but it's still a lot.

308
00:36:10,247 --> 00:36:13,055
I planned to stay until I got well,

309
00:36:13,055 --> 00:36:15,766
but I like it here.

310
00:36:15,766 --> 00:36:20,646
We are going back to the U.S.
after you finish your class.

311
00:36:20,646 --> 00:36:23,040
So, can I stay here until then?

312
00:36:26,284 --> 00:36:28,255
It is not that safe,

313
00:36:28,255 --> 00:36:30,552
and I need to ask Ji Hwan first.

314
00:36:31,917 --> 00:36:34,001
Eun Seo stayed here before.

315
00:36:38,822 --> 00:36:40,297
I will stay.

316
00:36:43,149 --> 00:36:46,295
Have you met Eun Seo?

317
00:36:49,022 --> 00:36:52,049
I know you didn't go to her
when she was in the hospital.

318
00:36:54,734 --> 00:36:56,609
Have you met her?

319
00:37:03,983 --> 00:37:07,184
I met her today.

320
00:37:11,989 --> 00:37:13,744
You did.

321
00:37:15,477 --> 00:37:18,998
I expected it somewhat
when I booked the venue at the hotel.

322
00:37:23,012 --> 00:37:26,742
Yes, I booked it on purpose.

323
00:37:27,908 --> 00:37:30,453
You pretend you're all right,

324
00:37:30,453 --> 00:37:33,614
but you don't seem to be fully here.

325
00:37:33,614 --> 00:37:35,880
I feel like only an empty shell
of you is with me.

326
00:37:36,893 --> 00:37:38,647
I wanted to make sure.

327
00:37:41,100 --> 00:37:42,880
But you ended up meeting her.

328
00:37:44,062 --> 00:37:45,263
Yu Mi,

329
00:37:47,364 --> 00:37:48,647
don't worry.

330
00:37:50,845 --> 00:37:53,445
You are the only one I take care of.

331
00:37:53,445 --> 00:37:55,095
I chose you.

332
00:38:01,587 --> 00:38:03,006
I have to get changed.

333
00:38:36,768 --> 00:38:39,120
(Gallery Sol
Private View of Yoon Jun Seo)

334
00:39:33,627 --> 00:39:34,813
Tae Seok.

335
00:40:00,949 --> 00:40:03,764
I didn't think I could make it later,

336
00:40:03,764 --> 00:40:05,863
so I stopped by to see it
when no one was around.

337
00:40:07,773 --> 00:40:09,088
Weren't you going to meet me?

338
00:40:13,229 --> 00:40:14,242
No.

339
00:40:18,462 --> 00:40:20,135
I know you're blunt,

340
00:40:21,997 --> 00:40:23,791
but it is too much to take now.

341
00:40:25,013 --> 00:40:26,152
I should go.

342
00:40:26,653 --> 00:40:27,719
Tae Seok.

343
00:40:32,510 --> 00:40:34,257
Are you seeing Eun Seo again...

344
00:40:35,204 --> 00:40:36,921
with a good intention?

345
00:40:38,454 --> 00:40:39,454
What did you say?

346
00:40:41,740 --> 00:40:43,231
Eun Seo told me.

347
00:40:44,093 --> 00:40:46,298
I know I have no right to say that.

348
00:40:47,598 --> 00:40:49,183
But I'm asking you.

349
00:40:50,738 --> 00:40:52,253
Is it a good intention?

350
00:40:55,331 --> 00:40:59,903
Did Choi Eun Seo tell you
that we got back together?

351
00:40:59,903 --> 00:41:02,026
Are you sure you're not going to hurt her?

352
00:41:04,006 --> 00:41:05,234
See you later.

353
00:41:06,543 --> 00:41:08,950
Answer me, Han Tae Seok.

354
00:41:27,401 --> 00:41:28,523
Welcome.

355
00:41:36,601 --> 00:41:37,659
Mom.

356
00:41:39,696 --> 00:41:40,786
Excuse me for a moment.

357
00:41:43,439 --> 00:41:45,924
Mom, I'm glad you came.

358
00:41:50,399 --> 00:41:55,645
How much more will you make me worry?

359
00:41:55,645 --> 00:41:57,889
Is he really the only one for you?

360
00:41:59,837 --> 00:42:01,477
I'm glad you are here.

361
00:42:01,477 --> 00:42:02,807
Thank you so much.

362
00:42:18,350 --> 00:42:19,518
Mister.

363
00:42:22,549 --> 00:42:25,440
Are you still calling me mister?

364
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:27,337
Are you here for Manager Kim?

365
00:42:27,337 --> 00:42:28,350
Yes.

366
00:42:30,482 --> 00:42:33,681
You came to see Jun Seo's Private Preview.

367
00:42:33,681 --> 00:42:35,315
Yes, I stopped by to see her since I came.

368
00:42:35,930 --> 00:42:37,138
You're doing well.

369
00:42:37,829 --> 00:42:39,462
It should be enough to see I'm good.

370
00:42:39,462 --> 00:42:42,110
So, what are you still doing here?
You're distracting me from work.

371
00:42:42,110 --> 00:42:43,110
Just go.

372
00:42:43,110 --> 00:42:46,529
It's been a while. Let me stay longer.
I don't want to waste it.

373
00:42:46,529 --> 00:42:48,826
What are you saying?

374
00:42:48,826 --> 00:42:51,106
Have you paid to see Eun Seo?

375
00:42:51,106 --> 00:42:52,397
Why should I pay?

376
00:42:52,397 --> 00:42:54,535
- Take this.
- It's beautiful.

377
00:42:54,535 --> 00:42:56,193
- I need to get it back right away.
- Why is that?

378
00:42:56,193 --> 00:42:58,408
I'm here for Jun Seo's Private Preview,
and this is for him.

379
00:42:58,408 --> 00:43:00,617
You're so silly.

380
00:43:00,617 --> 00:43:03,189
By the way, this flower bouquet
is exquisite, isn't it?

381
00:43:16,404 --> 00:43:17,438
Change into this.

382
00:43:19,474 --> 00:43:22,733
Dress up. You can't go
to the Private View like that.

383
00:43:29,572 --> 00:43:31,950
I don't understand.

384
00:43:34,292 --> 00:43:36,175
You don't understand.

385
00:43:37,162 --> 00:43:38,917
Did you say you were seeing me again?

386
00:43:39,876 --> 00:43:42,643
I'm sure you have someone
you'd like to show off to...

387
00:43:42,643 --> 00:43:45,670
that we're seeing each other again.
Let's go and meet him.

388
00:43:46,283 --> 00:43:47,313
Tae Seok.

389
00:43:50,220 --> 00:43:53,476
What am I to you?
Am I just that much to you?

390
00:43:53,476 --> 00:43:54,968
Yoon Jun Seo and you.

391
00:43:58,597 --> 00:44:02,845
Don't you care about how I feel...
as long as you don't get Jun Seo hurt?

392
00:44:02,845 --> 00:44:04,445
Do my feelings for you...

393
00:44:06,747 --> 00:44:08,103
mean nothing to you?

394
00:44:08,996 --> 00:44:10,206
Tae Seok.

395
00:44:10,206 --> 00:44:11,549
Wear this.

396
00:44:11,549 --> 00:44:15,715
Don't call me Tae Seok from now on.

397
00:44:15,715 --> 00:44:17,502
I don't want to hear you call me that.

398
00:44:29,097 --> 00:44:30,998
You came. How are you?

399
00:44:30,998 --> 00:44:32,255
I love your paintings.

400
00:44:32,255 --> 00:44:34,024
I'm flattered.

401
00:44:34,024 --> 00:44:35,991
- How is Professor Park?
- He is well.

402
00:44:36,671 --> 00:44:39,349
Please have a drink. Excuse me.

403
00:44:40,865 --> 00:44:41,865
Hello.

404
00:44:41,865 --> 00:44:43,904
- Welcome.
- Thanks.

405
00:44:58,838 --> 00:45:00,782
I've changed my mind.

406
00:45:00,782 --> 00:45:03,382
I was thinking about
what I could do with Eun Seo,

407
00:45:03,382 --> 00:45:05,297
and figured it would be good to come here.

408
00:45:12,447 --> 00:45:13,925
Yes, I'm glad you came.

409
00:45:17,370 --> 00:45:18,909
Would you like a cocktail?

410
00:45:19,402 --> 00:45:20,477
Liquor?

411
00:45:22,114 --> 00:45:26,092
Are you sure
it's okay with you if I have drinks?

412
00:45:30,443 --> 00:45:32,842
Can I have drinks?

413
00:45:32,842 --> 00:45:35,721
You asked that we hang out all night long.

414
00:45:35,721 --> 00:45:36,803
Can I have drinks?

415
00:45:39,103 --> 00:45:40,103
Have them.

416
00:45:40,970 --> 00:45:43,443
She said I could. Let me bring drinks.

417
00:45:49,293 --> 00:45:51,717
What's wrong?

418
00:45:51,717 --> 00:45:53,330
We're getting married soon.

419
00:46:09,286 --> 00:46:10,304
Let's get out.

420
00:46:40,483 --> 00:46:43,688
Tae Seok is acting weird, isn't he?

421
00:46:46,252 --> 00:46:48,695
Are you really seeing him again?

422
00:46:51,251 --> 00:46:52,318
Are you?

423
00:46:55,403 --> 00:46:56,585
Yes.

424
00:46:58,324 --> 00:46:59,324
Yes, I am.

425
00:47:00,230 --> 00:47:01,456
Yes, I am, Jun Seo.

426
00:47:06,063 --> 00:47:07,152
Eun Seo.

427
00:47:09,779 --> 00:47:10,879
Yoon Jun Seo.

428
00:47:13,830 --> 00:47:15,103
What are you doing?

429
00:47:18,164 --> 00:47:19,413
Hello.

430
00:47:19,413 --> 00:47:21,071
I can't believe this.

431
00:47:21,471 --> 00:47:22,716
Eun Seo, go inside.

432
00:47:23,771 --> 00:47:26,778
What did you say?
Where does she think she's going?

433
00:47:26,778 --> 00:47:28,572
What are you saying?

434
00:47:30,099 --> 00:47:34,253
How dare you come here?

435
00:47:35,274 --> 00:47:37,756
Don't you know
what you've done to my daughter?

436
00:47:38,411 --> 00:47:39,492
Ma'am.

437
00:47:40,058 --> 00:47:42,076
- Mom.
- You caused her to almost die.

438
00:47:42,076 --> 00:47:44,167
How could you do this?

439
00:47:44,955 --> 00:47:46,965
Shame on you.

440
00:47:46,965 --> 00:47:47,983
Ma'am.

441
00:47:50,365 --> 00:47:52,965
What are you doing?

442
00:47:52,965 --> 00:47:54,683
Are you taking her side now?

443
00:47:55,902 --> 00:47:58,230
No, I am sorry.

444
00:47:58,230 --> 00:48:00,705
It is my fault. I apologize.

445
00:48:03,269 --> 00:48:04,751
Please excuse us.

446
00:48:07,775 --> 00:48:08,775
Eun Seo.

447
00:48:09,749 --> 00:48:10,914
Eun Seo.

448
00:48:11,341 --> 00:48:13,598
How rude she is.

449
00:48:13,598 --> 00:48:16,883
Where did she learn such manners?

450
00:48:16,883 --> 00:48:18,390
That is enough.

451
00:48:19,035 --> 00:48:21,430
- Yoon Jun Seo.
- Jun Seo.

452
00:48:29,527 --> 00:48:30,676
I am sorry.

453
00:48:50,535 --> 00:48:51,800
I am sorry.

454
00:48:53,173 --> 00:48:55,090
You didn't need to do that.

455
00:48:55,090 --> 00:48:57,026
Don't expect my apology.

456
00:48:57,026 --> 00:48:58,549
I'm not sorry at all.

457
00:49:00,788 --> 00:49:02,446
But of course not.

458
00:49:02,446 --> 00:49:05,976
You and Jun Seo, you two deserve this.

459
00:49:09,013 --> 00:49:13,024
I will bring these clothes
back to your room tomorrow.

460
00:49:17,798 --> 00:49:19,129
I'm relieved.

461
00:49:20,567 --> 00:49:24,697
Jun Seo didn't seem to notice
I lied to him.

462
00:49:27,846 --> 00:49:29,056
Are you really...

463
00:49:30,558 --> 00:49:31,989
Thank you.

464
00:49:33,081 --> 00:49:34,949
I won't put you
in this situation ever again.

465
00:51:04,525 --> 00:51:06,408
I think you have leukemia.

466
00:51:08,380 --> 00:51:09,451
Look at me.

467
00:51:09,451 --> 00:51:10,456
Love?

468
00:51:11,597 --> 00:51:12,629
Don't be ridiculous.

469
00:51:12,629 --> 00:51:15,337
I'm not your toy.

470
00:51:16,254 --> 00:51:17,877
Yu Mi.

471
00:51:17,877 --> 00:51:19,895
We're going to the U.S. in two months.

472
00:51:28,533 --> 00:51:30,056
Is it an anticancer drug?

473
00:51:33,181 --> 00:51:35,848
You can't die.

474
00:51:37,702 --> 00:51:39,000
Let me help you cure cancer.

475
00:51:41,414 --> 00:51:45,511
Must you return to the U.S.?
